An individual served as '''governor''' of [[Hanna City]],<ref name="Aldhani">{{Andor|Aldhani (episode)}}</ref> the [[capital]] of the [[planet]] [[Chandrila]].<ref name="Aftermath">[[Aftermath (novel)|''Aftermath'']]</ref> They were an old regimental friend of [[Perrin Fertha]], who was planning to host a dinner for the governor along with his [[Marriage|wife]] [[Mon Mothma]],<ref name="Aldhani" /> the [[Imperial Senate|Imperial senator]] of Chandrila.<ref name="Ultimate Star Wars">''[[Ultimate Star Wars]]''</ref> The dinner was to take place in their [[Chandrilan Embassy|apartment]] on [[Coruscant]].<ref name="Aldhani" />

